<title>UK: Nederlandse Waterschapsbank sets $200 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Nederlandse Waterschapsbank sets $200 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Tokyo-Mitsubishi International plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    20.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.345   PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.12    SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.225     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND WHEN ISSUED TWO-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE  NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
